    "description": "Title\n: Uncover Cobra Science Kit Robot Globe Electrostorm Disc Rock Collection Set\nBrand\n: Multiple\nModel\n: Various\nColor\n: Multicolor\nDepartment\n: Science & Education\nCategory\n: Others\nDescription\n: Dive into discovery with this varied Science Explorer Lot, perfect for students, collectors, or anyone curious about the wonders of Earth and space. This assortment includes a boxed ELECTROSTORM DISC for engaging electric light effects, a boxed 'Rocks on the Go' 48-stone collection by Scholastic, a large organized geode and mineral set in a display case, and a classic spinning globe with wood base for world exploration. Also present are two volumes of Black Science comic paperbacks, an educational Uncover the Cobra 3D anatomy kit book, a vintage-style sand timer, a sturdy pith helmet for field or costume use, and a mysterious black retro robot figure. Additional unique pieces include insect resin specimens, a selection of individual stones (such as pyrite and agate), a hand lens, and a colorful articulated lizard model. All items are shown and described by visible features, with clear evidence of varying gently used and vintage conditions, showing only minor signs of wear and box age.\nSOME ITEMS CONTAIN AGE/WEAR/DAMAGE/STAINS\nSOLD AS IS\nCibolo\nNotes\nLOCAL PICK-UP IS NOW AVAILABLE.\nPLEASE CONTACT CUSTOMER SERVICE TO SCHEDULE AN APPOINTMENT. YOU MUST MAKE AN APPOINTMENT FOR LOCAL PICK-UP ITEMS. LOCAL PICK-UP IS AVAILABLE MONDAY-FRIDAY 8am-4pm CST\nIF YOU HAVE ANY QUESTIONS PLEASE CONTACT OUR\nCUSTOMER SERVICE DEPARTMENT AT\n(726) 237-7616\nOR CLICK ON THE CUSTOMER SERVICE TAB IN SHOPGOODWILL.COM\nUsed Items Disclaimer\nThis is a pre-owned item and is being sold “AS IS ” If you have any questions concerning this item, feel free to contact us\nAll items (including new) are donated and may pick up dust/debris from warehouse – wash/clean before you wear/use\nWe describe our items to the best of our ability and try to incorporate as much