    "description": "Natural History Specimen\nFour Polished Petrified Wood Slices\nFossilized Wood and Mineralized Silica\nApproximately 16\" x 12\" x 11\" (Lot Dimensions)\nUnsigned\nThis collection of four polished petrified wood slices showcases the intricate process of permineralization, where organic wood fibers are replaced by minerals over millions of years while retaining the original cellular structure. Each specimen displays distinct annual growth rings and vibrant color variations ranging from deep onyx blacks to warm ochre and cream, typical of ancient coniferous or hardwood species. The faces have been polished to a high luster, revealing crystalline structures and unique geological signatures, while the perimeters retain the rugged, natural texture of fossilized bark.\nProfessionally polished faces highlighting internal mineral structures and growth patterns\nNatural rough-hewn edges providing a stark contrast between raw earth and refined surface\nSubstantial total weight of 24 pounds suitable for architectural display or specimen collection\nCondition:\nVery good condition with stable mineral structures. As natural specimens, these pieces exhibit inherent fissures, inclusions, and voids characteristic of the fossilization process. Surfaces are polished to a high gloss with minimal abrasions and the specimens remain structurally sound.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
